    "title": "Plaistow Supervisors of the Checklist Register Voters, Make Changes April 16 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WHAV News Staff ,\n1 hours ago The Supervisors of the Checklist in Plaistow, N.H., are registering new voters and making changes requested by existing voters when it meets next week. Supervisors will also be working a 30-day letter list for voters presumed to have moved out of Plaistow. They meet Thursday April 16, from 5:30-6 p.m., at the Town Clerk’s Office, Town Hall, 145 Main St., Plaistow. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
